OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely dry and bright day
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells and feeling pleasant
OL,7,Fin the sunshine.
OL,8,
OL,9,CTonight:FMost showers dying out but a
OL,10,Ffew may continue to affect the North
OL,11,FCoast. Otherwise, dry with clear
OL,12,Fspells and becoming rather chilly with
OL,13,Fpatchy fog developing overnight.
OL,14,
OL,15,CSunday:FEarly fog patches quickly
OL,16,Fclearing to leave a largely dry day
OL,17,Fwith sunny spells. A chance of the odd
OL,18,Fshower near the North Coast at first.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
